{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Snout About, you and your friends play as dogs on a walk in the park. But oh no, your owner is going to miss the bus if you don't help them reach it in time! Together, drag the human through the stylised 3D park and get to the bus in time. Be careful not to pull them into objects and trees, as recovering them will cost you precious time. Collect bonus treats and other fun activities along the way for extra points. Communicate with your team and find the most efficient way to catch the bus to be the best buddies you can be.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629640?t=1754041657","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629640/21f9dafa631ef7efbc8c95660d8af84b46bcd999/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754041657","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629640/42b1eecb298031e1244616353c7111c145ad58f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754041657","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629640/42b1eecb298031e1244616353c7111c145ad58f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754041657","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Snout About, you and your friends play as dogs on a walk in the park. But oh no, your owner is going to miss the bus if you don't help them reach it in time! Together, drag the human through the stylised 3D park and get to the bus in time. Be careful not to pull them into objects and trees, as recovering them will cost you precious time. Collect bonus treats and other fun activities along the way for extr